 "text": "-->\nSheriff's Office | deuelcountysd\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nWelcome to Deuel County, South Dakota\nHOME\nDeuel County Commissioners\n2026 Commissioner Meetings\nArchived Commissioner Meeting Minutes\nList of County Offices\nAuditor\nClerk of Courts\nCommunity Health Nurse\nDirector of Equalization\nEmergency Management\n4-H Youth Program\nHighway Dept.\nICAP\nPlanning and Zoning\n2026 Zoning Meetings\nArchived Zoning Board Minutes\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff's Office\nState's Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeterans Service Officer\nWeed Supervisor\nContact/More info\nCounty Job Opening\nCourthouse History\nTown & Township Contact Information\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nSheriff's Office\nThe Deuel County Sheriff's Office covers 637 square miles and serves over 4,312 people with a sheriff, five deputies, and one administrative assistant. The office duties include 24/7 electronic alcohol monitoring, answering calls of service, background fingerprinting, civil/criminal paper service, issues concealed pistol permits, investigates accidents and crimes, transports prisoners, community safety talks, security of the courts, 911 coordinator, traffic control during events, traffic enforcement and works within the communities and schools throughout Deuel County.\nHelpful Links\n​\nSafeTravel USA-SD\n​\nSafeTravel USA\n​\nhttp://www.weather.gov/abr/\n​\nhttps://sor.sd.gov/\nhttp://sdsos.gov/general-services/concealed-pistol-permits/default.aspx\n​\n​\nUniform Patch Requests\nThe Deuel County Sheriff's uniform patch will only be issued to authorized employees and is not available to the public.\nSheriff Cory Borg\nOffice located on the first floor of the Courthouse.\n​\nPO Box 217\n408 4th St. West\nClear Lake, SD 57226\nPhone (605) 874-8212\nEmergency: Call 911\n​\nBusiness Hours of Operation:\nMonday - Friday: 8:00 a.m.-5:00 p.m.\nOffice closed all state & federal holidays\n​\nemail: deuelco@itctel.com\nSheriff Cory Borg\nSergeant Ty Wik\nDeputy Matt Nutter\nDeputy Dillon Krosch\nDeputy Kason Hinton\nDeputy Brandon Collins\nAdmin Mindi Dailey\n​\nClick here to\ngo HOME .\nCourthouse hours\n8:00 a.m. -5:00 p.m.\nClosed weekends and\nall state and federal holidays\n​\nCourthouse address\n408 4th Street West\nClear Lake, SD 57226\n© 2018 by Deuel County Proudly created with Wix.com\nPlease contact the specific office with your questions or concerns by clicking on the CONTACT US link below.\n​\nCONTACT US\nbottom of page",
